---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import StatCallout from "../components/StatCallout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Benchmarks"
  description="Real, measured results from three independent consumer battle-tests: LangChain/TS, LlamaIndex/Python, and an agentic Mastra RAG pipeline."
>
  <h1>Benchmarks</h1>
  <p>
    Every number on this page came from a real battle-test against a live local Zerocache instance
    with real provider keys — not a synthetic benchmark.
  </p>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Re-indexing an edited corpus</h2>
    <p>
      A 9-document corpus, re-indexed after editing one document and adding another. The other 7,
      byte-identical between versions, were served from cache for free.
    </p>
    <div class="chart chart--composition" role="img" aria-label="9-item re-index: 7 cache hits, 2 provider calls">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 320 40" preserveAspectRatio="none">
        <rect x="0" y="8" width="245" height="24" rx="4" fill="var(--hit)" />
        <rect x="247" y="8" width="73" height="24" rx="4" fill="var(--miss)" />
      </svg>
      <div class="chart__labels">
        <span class="chart__label chart__label--hit">7 cache hits (free)</span>
        <span class="chart__label chart__label--miss">2 provider calls</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Miss vs. hit latency</h2>
    <p>Measured in the Mastra agentic battle-test, same corpus, before and after caching.</p>
    <div class="chart-grid">
      <div class="chart chart--pair">
        <h3 class="chart__title">Ingest (per doc)</h3>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" role="img" aria-label="Ingest latency: 983 milliseconds before caching, 5 milliseconds after">
          <rect x="20" y="4" width="24" height="86" rx="4" fill="var(--miss)" />
          <rect x="76" y="87" width="24" height="3" rx="1.5" fill="var(--hit)" />
          <text x="32" y="98" text-anchor="middle" class="chart__tick">before</text>
          <text x="88" y="98" text-anchor="middle" class="chart__tick">after</text>
        </svg>
        <div class="chart__values">
          <span class="chart__value chart__value--miss">983ms</span>
          <span class="chart__value chart__value--hit">5ms</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="chart chart--pair">
        <h3 class="chart__title">Query</h3>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" role="img" aria-label="Query latency: about 600 milliseconds before caching, about 1 millisecond after">
          <rect x="20" y="4" width="24" height="86" rx="4" fill="var(--miss)" />
          <rect x="76" y="88" width="24" height="2" rx="1" fill="var(--hit)" />
          <text x="32" y="98" text-anchor="middle" class="chart__tick">before</text>
          <text x="88" y="98" text-anchor="middle" class="chart__tick">after</text>
        </svg>
        <div class="chart__values">
          <span class="chart__value chart__value--miss">~600ms</span>
          <span class="chart__value chart__value--hit">~1ms</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Three independent consumers</h2>
    <div class="stat-row">
      <StatCallout value="18/18" label="Mastra agentic checks passed" tone="hit" />
      <StatCallout value="18/19" label="LlamaIndex/Python real-key tests passed (1 external rate-limit)" tone="hit" />
      <StatCallout value="17/17" label="LangChain/TS real-key tests passed" tone="hit" />
    </div>
    <p>
      LangChain/TS (a raw embedding client, OpenAI) found the bare-string <code>input</code> gap and
      the first measured coalescing number. LlamaIndex/Python (Gemini, a second language ecosystem)
      confirmed the fixes held against a second provider. Mastra (an <em>agentic</em> pipeline —
      an LLM deciding which tool to call, not a direct embedding client) confirmed the same behavior
      holds when Zerocache is several layers removed from the caller, and exercised the
      <code>DELETE</code> routes end-to-end for the first time.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .chart-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(140px, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-4);
    max-width: 400px;
  }
  .chart {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }
  .chart--pair svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }
  .chart__title {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .chart__tick {
    fill: var(--muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 6px;
  }
  .chart__values {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-around;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
  .chart__value--miss {
    color: var(--miss);
  }
  .chart__value--hit {
    color: var(--hit);
  }
  .chart--composition svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 40px;
    max-width: 480px;
  }
  .chart__labels {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    max-width: 480px;
  }
  .chart__label--hit {
    color: var(--hit);
  }
  .chart__label--miss {
    color: var(--miss);
  }
  .stat-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-5);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin: var(--space-3) 0;
  }
</style>
